,347],{},"Blob"," to have the component save it under ",[291,350,335],{},", or return nothing if the page handled the download itself (for example by opening a new tab). While downloading, the button shows a spinner and ignores repeated clicks; throwing an error shows the download failed toast (requires ",[291,353,354],{},"UApp","), and the passed ",[291,357,358],{},"signal"," is aborted on unmount. With a local ",[291,361,182],{},", the local file is downloaded directly and ",[291,364,339],{}," is not called.",[288,367,368,369,373],{},"When the file name is truncated, hovering or keyboard focus shows the full name, or a long press on touch devices (see ",[370,371,217],"a",{"href":372},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the file dialog.",[320,375],{"name":376},"file-existing",[301,378,380],{"id":379},"clearing","Clearing",[288,382,383,386,387,389,390,392,393,395,396,392,398,401,402,405,406,408],{},[291,384,385],{},"clear"," is on by default and shows a trailing clear button when there is a local ",[291,388,182],{}," or an existing attachment; it is hidden while disabled or loading. Clearing sets ",[291,391,343],{}," to ",[291,394,313],{}," and ",[291,397,335],{},[291,399,400],{},"''",", leaving the field completely empty so a new file can be selected. Bind the attachment name with ",[291,403,404],{},"v-model:file-name"," so the page can tell from ",[291,407,400],{}," that the user removed the existing attachment; when it is passed one-way, clearing still empties the field.",[288,410,411,412,415,416,419,420,423,424,428,429,433],{},"Pass ",[291,413,414],{},":clear=\"false\""," to disallow removal; it is off by default inside a ",[291,417,418],{},"required"," ",[291,421,422],{},"UFormField",", following the same rules as the ",[370,425,427],{"href":426},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fselect-menu#clear-button","SelectMenu clear button",". To turn it off across the project, use the ",[370,430,432],{"href":431},